{"id":"e90b41cc3c4bd226","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone.md","title":"不完备 c.e. 集的 Turing 下锥构造维数零","display":"thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone — 不完备 c.e. 集的 Turing 下锥构造维数零","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone","aliases":["43-thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone"],"display":"thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone — 不完备 c.e. 集的 Turing 下锥构造维数零","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-thm-arslanov]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-constructive-class-dimension]]","[[43-thm-dim-positive-fpf]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"Cor.17.5.7, printed pp.524–525 / PDF pp.544–545","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-ce-incomplete-cone — 不完备 c.e. 集的 Turing 下锥构造维数零"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1677d7f7248ffdaa\" href=\"?note=1677d7f7248ffdaa\" title=\"43-thm-arslanov\">43-thm-arslanov</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" href=\"?note=c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" title=\"43-df-constructive-class-dimension\">43-df-constructive-class-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f17f2aaa45f81579\" href=\"?note=f17f2aaa45f81579\" title=\"43-thm-dim-positive-fpf\">43-thm-dim-positive-fpf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Cor.17.5.7, printed pp.524–525 / PDF pp.544–545"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&lt;_T\\varnothing\\prime\">\\(A&lt;_T\\varnothing\\prime\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；其余符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" href=\"?note=c8f3f2f2b8a397fe\" title=\"43-df-constructive-class-dimension\">43-df-constructive-class-dimension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cdim}(\\{\\operatorname{AsSequence}(B):B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land B\\le_T A\\})=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cdim}(\\{\\operatorname{AsSequence}(B):B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land B\\le_T A\\})=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若下锥内某点正维数，它计算 FPF，因 A 计算该点，所以 A 计算 FPF；Arslanov 完备性判据迫使 c.e. A 完备，矛盾。这里保留 c.e. 与 Turing 不完备两个假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-arslanov","status":"resolved","id":"1677d7f7248ffdaa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-arslanov]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-constructive-class-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"c8f3f2f2b8a397fe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"